OL,3,GNEWSAStranger to row Atlantic with crew
OL,4,Ain ocean dash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere, they found Taylor Lawrence, a
OL,7,Fwilderness guide from Utah, United
OL,8,FStates, who agreed to join the row -
OL,9,Fwhich is expected to take between 50
OL,10,Fand 60 days - despite having only
OL,11,Fshared one phone call with the group.
